+4. The reverse dependency closure of final release Task `TASK-260830-55kcni` contains exactly 186 Tasks, all inside M0-M4. It contains zero advisory-human Tasks and no out-of-scope record. The only M0-M4 leaf Tasks outside that implementation closure are the two metadata review Tasks in `STORY-260830-323tpq`: `TASK-260830-3lihxh` and `TASK-260830-yhxlow`.
